  "content_html": "<p>Thanks for reading Stock Analysis Compilation! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p><blockquote><h3><strong>🧰 Meet my new free tool for idea generation: <a href=\"https://www.hfbestideas.com/tools/fund-overlap?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weekly_digest&amp;utm_content=free-tool\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Fund Overlap</a></strong></h3><p>Enter 2 to 4 US stocks you own. We scan 13F filings (filtering out index huggers) to find active managers who hold them, and reveal what else they own with high conviction.</p><p>The result? A curated shortlist of under-the-radar stocks favored by managers who share your thesis. A starting point for your research, not financial advice.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.hfbestideas.com/tools/fund-overlap?s=COST&amp;s=CPRT&amp;s=MSCI&amp;utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=weekly_digest&amp;utm_content=free-tool-example\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See a live example</a></p><p>(Free, no account needed)</p></blockquote><hr /><h3>USA</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.capitalist-letters.com/p/applovin-deep-dive-not-a-no-brainer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AppLovin (APP US) by capitalist-letters</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.onlycfo.io/p/will-bending-spoons-buy-bigcommerce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">BigCommerce (BIGC US) by onlycfo</a></p><p><a href=\"https://recital.substack.com/p/quick-update-vuse-pro-launch-in-the\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">British American Tobacco (BTI US) by recital</a></p><p><a href=\"https://jimmysjournal.substack.com/p/credo-crdo-deep-dive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Credo Technology Group Holding Ltd (CRDO US) by jimmysjournal</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.cannibalstocks.com/p/9-million-shares-then-15-then-a-30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dillard’s (DDS US) by cannibalstocks</a></p><p><a href=\"https://featherfund.substack.com/p/following-the-money-fico\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FICO (FICO US) by featherfund</a></p><p><a href=\"https://thedutchinvestors.substack.com/p/turnaround-lessons-from-ibm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">IBM (IBM US) by thedutchinvestors</a></p><p><a href=\"https://hatedmoats.substack.com/p/lululemon-deep-dive-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lululemon Athletica (LULU US) by hatedmoats</a></p><p><a href=\"https://optionsoracle.substack.com/p/meta-take-profit-alert-locking-in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Meta Platforms (META US) by optionsoracle</a></p><p><a href=\"https://valueb9b.substack.com/p/olli-negative-same-store-sales-growth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ollie’s Bargain Outlet (OLLI US) by valueb9b</a></p><p><a href=\"https://investresearch.substack.com/p/on-holding-onon-i-bought-the-shoes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">On Holding AG (ONON US) by investresearch</a></p><p><a href=\"https://thefinancecorner.substack.com/p/reddit-becoming-cash-generating-machine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Reddit (RDDT US) by thefinancecorner</a></p><p><a href=\"https://dbsilverfox.substack.com/p/the-ultimate-franchise-business\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Walt Disney Company (DIS US) by dbsilverfox</a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.compoundwithrene.com/p/three-cents-in-bangkok-one-cent-in\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tiger Brokers (TIGR US) by compoundwithrene</a></p><p><a href=\"https://researchragnarok.substack.com/p/thirty-years-of-nothing-our-suggestions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">TransAct Technologies (TACT US) by researchragnarok</a></p><p><a href=\"https://longtermpick.com/p/uber-analysis\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Uber (UBER US) by longtermpick</a></p><p><em><a href=\"https://www.hfbestideas.com/?page